{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-d1ede91e3649","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-d1ede91e3649","name":"清蒸南瓜","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E6%B8%85%E8%92%B8%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C.md","blob_sha":"a969be9c575ad16ee6f0330e20b98dca3b0428f8","details":{"introduction":"一道原汁原味的家常蒸菜，最大程度保留南瓜的天然甜味与营养，口感软糯香甜，既可当甜点也可作主食。南瓜富含β-胡萝卜素和膳食纤维，有益视力与肠胃健康。制作极其简单，新手也能轻松搞定，从切配到出锅仅需 15-20 分钟。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 南瓜\n- 蒸锅"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1-2 个人吃。\n\n每份：\n\n- 南瓜 300 g\n- 饮用水 1000 ml （用于蒸锅）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将 南瓜 外皮洗净，去除瓜瓤和籽。\n2. 将 南瓜 切成厚度大约 2 cm 的片，备用。\n3. 在 蒸锅 的锅中加入 1000 ml 饮用水。\n4. 将切好的 南瓜 片均匀摆放在盘中。\n5. 待蒸锅中的水烧开后，将装有 南瓜 的盘子放入蒸锅中。\n6. 盖上锅盖，保持大火蒸 **15-20 分钟**，直至南瓜变软，可以用筷子轻松穿透。\n7. 关火，小心取出盘子。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 南瓜的品种不同，甜度和口感会有差异。老南瓜通常更甜更面。\n- 南瓜皮含有营养，如果喜欢也可以不去皮蒸，但需要彻底洗净。\n- 蒸的时间取决于南瓜块的大小和厚度，以及南瓜的品种。用筷子测试是判断是否蒸熟的好方法。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：南瓜450g；整份约420g。去皮去籽净南瓜，不把蒸锅用水算进食材。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":27.857143,"protein_g":1.071429,"carbohydrate_g":6.964286,"fat_g":0.107143},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168448/nutrients","version":"de9f4948fedc4ca7","fdc_ids":[168448]},"profile_id":"family-d1ede91e3649-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d1ede91e3649","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-d1ede91e3649","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"covered_steaming","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-d1ede91e3649-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"pumpkin","grams":450}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"de9f4948fedc4ca7","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-d1ede91e3649-v1.2d54a8570e248bdd.json","bytes":10252,"sha256":"2d54a8570e248bddd32e366274264d4f0b511d5ea539ace68bb295a1759c9bba"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-d1ede91e3649-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d1ede91e3649","recipe_blob_sha":"a969be9c575ad16ee6f0330e20b98dca3b0428f8","version":"1","data_version":"de9f4948fedc4ca7","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":420,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品420g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：南瓜450g；整份约420g。去皮去籽净南瓜，不把蒸锅用水算进食材。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-d1ede91e3649","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"covered_steaming","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-d1ede91e3649-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"pumpkin","grams":450}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":27.857143,"protein_g":1.071429,"carbohydrate_g":6.964286,"fat_g":0.107143},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168448/nutrients","version":"de9f4948fedc4ca7","fdc_ids":[168448]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-d1ede91e3649-v1.2d54a8570e248bdd